=== D-CASFCH: GET/PUT/FIELD/INPUT$ on a CAS: channel, MEASURED ===

program (identical on both sides):
    5 MAXFILES=3
    10 ONERRORGOTO900
    20 E=0:OPEN"CAS:T"FOR OUTPUT AS#1:POKE&HD005,E
    30 E=0:FIELD#1,10 AS A$:POKE&HD006,E
    40 E=0:GET#1,1:POKE&HD007,E
    50 E=0:PUT#1,1:POKE&HD008,E
    60 E=0:A$=INPUT$(1,#1):POKE&HD009,E
    65 POKE&HD00A,&HA5
    70 E=0:OPEN"LPT:"FOR OUTPUT AS#2:POKE&HD00B,E
    72 E=0:FIELD#2,10 AS B$:POKE&HD00C,E
    74 E=0:GET#2,1:POKE&HD00D,E
    76 E=0:A$=INPUT$(1,#2):POKE&HD00E,E
    78 POKE&HD00F,&HA5
    79 E=0:OPEN"CAS:D"FOR INPUT AS#3:POKE&HD010,E
    81 E=0:FIELD#3,10 AS C$:POKE&HD011,E
    82 E=0:GET#3,1:POKE&HD012,E
    83 E=0:PUT#3,1:POKE&HD013,E
    84 E=0:A$=INPUT$(1,#3):POKE&HD014,E
    86 POKE&HD015,&HA5
    88 END
    900 E=ERR:RESUME NEXT

-- zerobas: AUTOEXEC.BAS from disk + $EA tape, RAM read back --

